enough questions about the samples to see&nbsp;
which one can make the most improvements.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:04.920
Sometimes you order samples, and&nbsp;
maybe one of them had, I don't know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:09.280
a scratch and the other one didn't. So you're&nbsp;
choosing that other product because it didn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

