So actually, Greg, actually, I want to&nbsp;
talk about those first two points. First,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:40.840
because they're quite interesting&nbsp;
because between Simon and myself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:44.840
we've had a lot of experience in the&nbsp;
drop shipping space. And if you think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:52.240
about due diligence or even the first step&nbsp;
of due diligence. Right, due diligence in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.240 --> 00:09:01.600
traditional drop shipping is what? Finding ten&nbsp;
different Aliexpress links and researching them.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:09.840
So even the fact that you're talking about not&nbsp;
only looking at 30 to 50 options or more than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:15.400
ten even, but you're literally talking about&nbsp;
going to the companies or trade companies or&nbsp;&nbsp;

