00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:25.560
of dropshippers or early DTC ecommerce brand&nbsp;
owners, you really have to have that kind of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:31.560
mindset if you really want to have the right,&nbsp;
either the best quality or the most efficient&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:35.360
production for your products as well. And&nbsp;
that goes into this idea of sampling, right?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:42.560
I remember from my experience with a lot of&nbsp;
traditional dropshippers, typically, well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:47.320
there's no sampling in traditional drop shipping.&nbsp;
The sampling comes after the fact. The sampling&nbsp;&nbsp;

