that I see from a more established sourcing&nbsp;
process for you to see ecommerce brand versus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:14.400
what I really think is a limited approach&nbsp;
to traditional dropshipping sourcing.

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:19.960
That's correct. I think due diligence is key&nbsp;
because this is the beginning phase of our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:25.440
relationship-building with the manufacturers&nbsp;
as well. When we deal with consumer products,&nbsp;&nbsp;

