00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:56.840
manufacturer? So while doing this due diligence,&nbsp;
we really are trying to figure out what's the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.840 --> 00:11:02.280
right fit for the company based on the volumes&nbsp;
that they'll be purchasing or scaling into.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:08.920
Or should they just be working with a smaller&nbsp;
