00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:13.240
one at a later time because they'll get more&nbsp;
preferential treatment? Something like that.&nbsp;

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:20.000
Fourth step would just be quality control. I think&nbsp;
one of the pitfalls there is that most customers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:26.720
dealing directly with China don't really have a&nbsp;
QC checklist system in place with the supplier.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:32.160
