00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:36.920
updates from the manufacturer when materials are&nbsp;
coming in when they're going to start assembly.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:41.320
How are they handling the QC process after?&nbsp;
Are they going to be sending us our pictures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:46.600
and videos so we could provide it to&nbsp;
the clients? A lot of our DTC brands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:52.720
want the video so they can use it for&nbsp;
marketing. So we try to get them as the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:57.040
best possible pictures of either an assembly&nbsp;
line or we have some products that are just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:01.560
more machine-made and less like a manual&nbsp;
process. So get them pictures of that so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:05.960
that they could really show that their stuff&nbsp;
