I think they do get asked by other people as well.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:03.200
So that's just something that we always&nbsp;
try to do just so that they know that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:07.480
their stuff is being made, they know it's&nbsp;
being made in a clean place. So, yeah,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:12.622
I think it's really valuable to be getting those&nbsp;
