to make sure that comes out at a high quality,&nbsp;
then that's where you're going to have problems.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:19.480
And in a way, it's not going to&nbsp;
be the factory's fault as well.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:20.840
Yeah, I agree.

